  "opener": "A SAMAN container coffee shop is the standard container cafe shell fitted out for coffee: dedicated espresso and grinder circuits, a treated water point feeding the machine, under-counter waste, display glazing at the counter face and a branded frontage planned around pickup speed. The shell, the steel and the insulation are the same as the container cafe range, and the price ladder is the same, from ₹2,03,500 ex-factory, ex-GST. What differs is everything a barista touches, which is why this page covers the fit-out and workflow rather than repeating the structural specification.",
